  "id": "quid-pro-quo",
  "term": "quid pro quo",
  "definition": "Quid pro quo refers to a transactional, exchange-based view of relationships in which one party gives something in return for something else. In this context, it contrasts with an attachment-based perspective by emphasizing simple reciprocity rather than relational security.",
